{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1230119-exalted-mobile-homes","id":1230119,"title":"Exalted Mobile Homes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-25T16:28:08-07:00","id":1230119,"title":"Exalted Mobile Homes","content":"Yaga Baba\u2019s chicken-legged house. Samus Aran\u2019s various ships. Howl\u2019s moving castle. Warframe\u2019s Liset. Anthem\u2019s striders. <br /> <br /> Sometimes, heroes need to take their homes with them.<br /> <br /> How many of you installed a bed, lavatory, kitchen, and workshop into your Chariot of Aerial Conquest?<br /> <br /> Or made a creature of Legendary Size your familiar just so that you could build a permanent, habitable howdah on its nigh-oblivious back?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-25T16:51:39-07:00","id":1230128,"title":"","content":"Taking any one building from a city and making it a mobile one is always pretty awesome. I think it covers the airship trope without needing the airship well enough, and csn bridgr the gap between 'nameless wanders going from village to village' and 'protect my hometown at all costs'.<br /> <br /> An extra buffed yeddim or some supernatural beast of burden would do well (Netflix anime Seven Deadly Sins does it well with their mobile bar). It definitely gets more epic than your average merchant's wagon.<br /> <br /> I'm now trying to picture some odd clay golem with a giant furnace in it belly for the Twilight to forge his weapons in as they travel upon its hunched back<br /> <br /> Sidenote: i had to make sure this wasn't some weird picture of a solid gold rv or trailer hitched mobile home. Though an indestructible Artifact RV would be a neat way to travel in style into battle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24220-cryo-seraph","name":"Cryo-Seraph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-25T17:44:23-07:00","id":1230135,"title":"","content":"... I have randomly decided there's a Storm Mother with an ancient hatred for an ancient hearth goddess worshipped by a bunch of nomadic cultures.<br /> <br /> Therefore, in Creation, tornadoes (Storm Serpents?) do in fact go after mobile homes.<br /> <br /> Fun antagonist for your PCs!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-25T19:58:03-07:00","id":1230164,"title":"","content":"I've consider an artifact &quot;train&quot; that either floats or carries itself on millipede legs.<br /> <br /> The cars between the engine and caboose are capable of breaking away and forming their own train to run off to safety with their passengers and cargo while the engine and caboose combine into a war machine to stay and fight.<br /> <br /> The war machine might be a warstrider.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T00:42:50-07:00","id":1230210,"title":"","content":"There was a demon someone made a while back (I forget where it is) that was an expy of Calcifer, complete with a moving castle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-26T02:29:25-07:00","id":1230218,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div cl